vent","id":"316744703","title":"🤝 Fast Friends: Meet New People \u0026 Make New Friends | Board Games | 25–45","dateTime":"2026-10-24T19:00:00-04:00","description":"You can live in a city full of people and still wonder, “Where do I actually meet new friends?”\n\nFast Friends makes that first step easy. Meet over 25 new people through relaxed, guided conversations, discover shared interests and then stay for drinks and board games with the people you click with.\n\n🎲 Stout has 50+ board games to enjoy after the hosted rounds, plus an After Dark Special from 9–11 PM with $7 beers and $7 highballs.\n\n🎟️ Book Online \u0026 Save: [https://toronto24thoct.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto24thoct.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door: CAD $20 cash — to host Kruttika\nBooking in advance helps us plan the right space and group size and guarantees your place.\n\n🍻 What to Expect\n7:00 PM – Welcome \u0026 Drinks\nMeet your host, Kruttika, grab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? Most people do! Our host will welcome you, make introductions and help you feel comfortable.\n\n🤝 7:30 PM – Fast Friends\nMeet a variety of friendly people through short, guided conversations.\nNo awkwardly approaching strangers — we guide the conversations and rotations, so you can simply focus on getting to know people.\n\n🎲 From 8:30 PM – Board Games \u0026 Mingling\nThe hosted rounds finish, but the evening doesn't have to.\nStay for drinks, play some easy social board games with the people you've met, or simply continue chatting and getting to know your new connections.\n\n❤️ Why People Love Fast Friends\n✔ Meet over 25 new people in one evening\n✔ No awkwardly approaching strangers — we guide the conversations\n✔ Most attendees come solo\n✔ Friendly hosts and a welcoming atmosphere\n✔ Common Ground Challenge to discover shared interests\n✔ Easy board games \u0026 socialising after the hosted rounds\n✔ Relaxed pub setting\n✔ Friendship-focused — not a dating even